  (text "Commander PoE HAT (rev H0) - the mainboard's PoE converter on a small board of its own, for a stock\nRadxa ZERO 3E used as the codec core.  The ZERO 3E keeps its own RJ45: the PoE voltage leaves it on its\n4-pin PoE header, this board turns it into 5 V, and the 5 V goes back in through the 40-pin header.\nThe converter itself (sheet poe) is the mainboard's 30_poe.net, listed in shared.txt." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 25.4 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid "66c96004-1b1c-581c-82a6-ab623e4dff1d"))
